{"comment": "alice starts 2048 alone, two moves are refused, then alice gives up. The two start tiles come from a random seed, so the cells and the movable directions are placeholders. Playing to no moves is covered by the Go rules tests and the smoke test."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 1, "type": "auth.login", "body": {"v": 1, "username": "alice", "password": "correct horse"}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 1, "type": "ok", "body": {"user": "alice", "heartbeat_ms": 15000}}}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 2, "type": "game.start", "body": {"game": "g2048", "options": {}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "g2048", "options": {}, "seq": 0, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "solver"}], "to_act": ["alice"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign", "abort"], "events": [], "view": {"cells": "$cells", "score": 0, "goal": 2048, "reached": false, "movable": "$movable"}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 2, "type": "ok", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "g2048", "options": {}, "seq": 0, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "solver"}], "to_act": ["alice"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign", "abort"], "events": [], "view": {"cells": "$cells", "score": 0, "goal": 2048, "reached": false, "movable": "$movable"}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"comment": "A direction is up, down, left or right; anything else is an illegal_action and the game does not move on."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 3, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 0, "action": {"kind": "move", "direction": "north"}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 3, "type": "error", "body": {"code": "illegal_action", "message": "direction must be one of up, down, left, right; got \"north\""}}}
{"comment": "So is an action the catalogue does not list."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 4, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 0, "action": {"kind": "slide", "direction": "up"}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 4, "type": "error", "body": {"code": "illegal_action", "message": "unknown action: slide"}}}
{"comment": "Giving up is the resign control: a loss with no winner, and the finishing push offers no move."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 5, "type": "game.control", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 0, "control": "resign"}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "g2048", "options": {}, "seq": 1, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "solver"}], "to_act": [], "result": {"kind": "decisive", "winners": [], "reason": "resign"}, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": [], "events": [], "view": {"cells": "$cells", "score": 0, "goal": 2048, "reached": false, "movable": []}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": "$finished_at", "summary": "$summary", "digest": "$digest", "exports": {}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 5, "type": "ok", "body": {"seq": 1}}}
{"comment": "Later reads keep the final view."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 6, "type": "game.snapshot", "body": {"game_id": "$game"}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 6, "type": "ok", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "g2048", "options": {}, "seq": 1, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "solver"}], "to_act": [], "result": {"kind": "decisive", "winners": [], "reason": "resign"}, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": [], "events": [], "view": {"cells": "$cells", "score": 0, "goal": 2048, "reached": false, "movable": []}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": "$finished_at", "summary": "$summary", "digest": "$digest", "exports": {}}}}
